  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australia Awards Pacific Scholarships (AAPS) is a multi-country initiative that provides access for developing country nationals to tertiary education. Funding under this initiative supports Papua New Guinea institutions.  Study areas are based on respective Papua New Guinean Government&apos;s priority areas as well as those of the Australian Aid program.</narrative>
